  section.section-compact.shell
    div.panel-grid
      article.panel
        span.panel-index 01
        h3 Find the real bottleneck
        p I start with work people already repeat: reading documents, entering product data, translating content, or navigating complex product data.
      article.panel
        span.panel-index 02
        h3 Keep people in control
        p Models propose fields, values, copy, or actions. The product makes confidence, review, and correction part of the normal workflow.
      article.panel
        span.panel-index 03
        h3 Engineer the failure path
        p Permission checks, timeouts, retries, stored state, and deterministic validation keep uncertain output from becoming silent product failure.
  section.section.shell.split
    div.split-intro
      span.eyebrow Document intelligence
      h2 From paper to structured data.
      p In Papereg, AI is embedded inside a complete document workflow rather than presented as a chat box.
      a.text-link href="/work/papereg/"
        | Read the Papereg case study 
        span aria-hidden="true" →
    div.prose
      section
        h3 PDF structure parsing
        p Uploaded forms are analyzed for labels, sections, field types, and layout so users can review a proposed digital form instead of rebuilding it by hand.
      section
        h3 OCR and batch extraction
        p Photos, scans, handwriting, checkboxes, and multi-page PDFs can become draft records. Failed files can be retried without losing successful results.
      section
        h3 Permission-aware assistance
        p The workspace assistant can answer questions and help create or fill drafts within a user’s permissions. Destructive, approval, and administration actions stay outside the assistant’s authority.
  section.section.shell.split
    div.split-intro
      span.eyebrow Multimodal commerce
      h2 Turn product photos into useful inventory.
      p ResellerIO combines vision, structured product data, image workflows, pricing context, and channel-specific copy.
      a.text-link href="/work/resellerio/"
        | Read the ResellerIO case study 
        span aria-hidden="true" →
    div.prose
      section
        h3 Extraction before generation
        p Photos become a structured draft with brand, category, size, color, material, and condition. Structured data keeps downstream features consistent.
      section
        h3 Image preparation
        p Background cleanup, crop preparation, and lifestyle image generation help sellers create a reusable asset set from the same intake.
      section
        h3 Drafts, not automatic publishing
        p Marketplace-specific titles, descriptions, and tags are presented for review. The seller remains responsible for what goes live.
  section.section.shell.split
    div.split-intro
      span.eyebrow Project intelligence
      h2 Keep engineering context connected.
      p HermIIS links product planning, decisions, documents, GitHub activity, and delivery analytics so AI can work from the same evidence as the team.
      a.text-link href="/work/hermiis/"
        | Read the HermIIS case study 
        span aria-hidden="true" →
    div.prose
      section
        h3 Graph-backed context
        p Tasks, features, decisions, documents, pull requests, and commits remain connected instead of becoming isolated pages.
      section
        h3 Evidence-aware assistance
        p Semantic search, graph expansion, and citation chains help people inspect the sources behind generated answers, reviews, and task proposals.
      section
        h3 Suggestions remain suggestions
        p AI can surface missing work or propose a decision record, while the team retains authority over scope, priorities, and architectural direction.
  section.section.shell
    div.section-heading
      div
        span.eyebrow Integration work
        h2 AI inside existing products.
      p I also integrate AI into mature systems where security, data ownership, and operational safety matter more than novelty.
    div.panel-grid
      article.panel
        span.panel-index MCP
        h3 OAuth-secured product access
        p Designed and built a Model Context Protocol server that lets ChatGPT integrate with product capabilities through explicit authentication and authorization.
      article.panel
        span.panel-index I18N
        h3 Localization automation
        p Combined OpenAI and DeepL APIs with an existing internationalization workflow to accelerate translation across Spanish, Chinese, Japanese, and Portuguese.
      article.panel
        span.panel-index DEV
        h3 Agent-assisted engineering
        p Use coding agents for focused implementation, audits, migrations, tests, documentation, and repetitive maintenance—while preserving review and verification.
